This ontology fragment defines the classes `User`, `WCKeyID`, `AccountName`, and response classes for the API calls `DeleteUser`, `DeleteWckey`, and `GetAccountInfo`. It also defines the object properties `hasName`, `hasWCKeyID`, and `hasAccountName`, and the datatype property `hasWCKeyID`. The response classes are subclasses of `Result`, and the domain and range for each API call are defined.
